If you intend to publish this mod, pick a license instead of leaving it
All Rights Reserved - see https://choosealicense.com/ for a comparison, then
update this file, `gradle.properties` (mod_license) and, if applicable,
`TEMPLATE_LICENSE.txt`:

- MIT / Apache-2.0 - permissive, easiest for packs and forks
- LGPL-2.1 / GPL-3.0 - the license the MinecraftForge/NeoForge loader itself uses
- MPL-2.0 / CC-BY-NC-SA - other common mod licenses

The build tooling copied from NeoForged's MDK keeps its own license, see
TEMPLATE_LICENSE.txt.
